## 🧰 Bill of Materials (BOM)

* **Klaw MK2 Robotic Gripper Kit:** 1
  * *Purpose:* Grips and releases the cube
* **Kitronik Linear Actuator Kit:** 1
  * *Purpose:* Provides left/right travel
* **BBC micro:bit (+ battery pack):** 1
  * *Purpose:* Reads button input, controls servos & sound
* **3D-printed actuator base:** 1
  * *Purpose:* Anchors the actuator kit
* **3D-printed gripper adaptor:** 1
  * *Purpose:* Mounts gripper to the actuator carriage
* **Push button module:** 1
  * *Purpose:* Start trigger input
* **Fasteners (M3 screws / nuts):** As needed
  * *Purpose:* Secures printed parts and kits
* **Test cube prop:** 1
  * *Purpose:* Object to be gripped and moved
